# TinyFFR {{VERSION}}

> TinyFFR (Tiny Fixed Function Renderer) is a C#/.NET library for real-time 3D rendering with physically-based materials, built on Google's Filament engine. It is published on NuGet as Egodystonic.TinyFFR, with integration packages for Avalonia, WPF, WinForms and Dear ImGui.

This is an index of the TinyFFR AI assistance package. Paths are relative to this file. `SKILL.md` gives an overview and the most important rules. The documentation pages under `docs/` are the same as the website (https://tinyffr.dev). The `api/` files are the XML API documentation, one file per namespace. The `examples/` folders are complete example applications.

